+
+## Loop quality by cohort
+
+| Loop quality | Exact | Near miss | Progressed | No progress |
+|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|
+| systematic | 97.2% | 72.6% | 84.1% | 56.2% |
+| mixed | 2.8% | 9.6% | 13.7% | 16.9% |
+| shotgun | 0.0% | 0.0% | 0.2% | 0.0% |
+| unknown | 0.0% | 17.7% | 2.0% | 26.9% |
